*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0005
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : D.P.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-02-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 778
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0005.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 WS-CAGE            PIC 9(3).
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MAXIMUM TERM IN YEARS
    05 T-CP               PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    05 EL-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM TERM-BY-AGE
    DISPLAY "T-CP=" T-CP
    DISPLAY "EL-IND=" EL-IND
    STOP RUN.
TERM-BY-AGE.
    IF WS-CAGE >= 18
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN WS-CAGE > 60
                MOVE 10 TO T-CP
                MOVE 'Y' TO EL-IND
            *> MEDIUM TERM CAP
            WHEN WS-CAGE > 50
                MOVE 20 TO T-CP
                MOVE 'Y' TO EL-IND
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 30 TO T-CP
                MOVE 'Y' TO EL-IND
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO EL-IND
    END-IF.
